BEGIN:VEVENT
SEQUENCE:3
DESCRIPTION:We will once again be having the “WHITE ELEPHANT GIFT EXCHANG
 E” at the department (s) Holiday Party.  For those of you who may not be
  familiar with this\, it is great fun and can provide a lot of laughs.  
 Whoever chooses to be involved (not mandatory)\, we make a list of names
 \, then December 6th you can draw a name.  (All those who wish to partic
 ipate need to have signed up no later than Monday December 5th ). You wi
 ll draw a name\, other than yourself\, and then you are responsible to b
 ring a gift to the person whose name you have drawn.  Now the fun part i
 s that generally these are recycled gifts or gag gifts\, something you j
 ust want to unload or something that reminds you of the person whose nam
 e you have drawn.  No money needs to be spent. (you can of course choose
  to buy a gift if you prefer). \n \nStop by my desk to sign up.\n \nDESS
 ERT\, there is always room for dessert\, if you wish\, you may also brin
 g a dessert to the holiday party to share.\n
UID:E5F0B191-B3CF-4751-A81E-D9182CCAD9D3
